{"unit_id":"kaaaaahn__dsh-vision#card-zh","repo":"kaaaaahn/dsh-vision","commit":"fc9bcbe94f823c86c67949ac4a96f5e03cec3807","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@zenk/vision 是面向 DSH 的本地视觉插件，可在桌面或网页客户端使用。它注册 vision_analyze 图片分析工具和 vision_setup 环境检测工具，并根据当前模型的图片能力处理粘贴图片。主要功能包括识别图片文字并返回像素坐标、检测矩形和标注区域、调用本机 Ollama 生成画面描述，以及在纯文本模型通道中把图片附件转换为带本地路径的说明。适合需要分析截图、定位界面文字或查看标注区域的 DSH 用户。OCR 使用 macOS Vision；语义描述需配置本机 Ollama 与 qwen3-vl 模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:425-453","lib/index.js:458-507","lib/vision_analyze.swift:21-70"]}
{"unit_id":"kaaaaahn__dsh-vision#card-en","repo":"kaaaaahn/dsh-vision","commit":"fc9bcbe94f823c86c67949ac4a96f5e03cec3807","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@zenk/vision adds local image analysis to DSH. vision_analyze returns OCR text with pixel coordinates and describes screenshots through local Ollama; vision_setup checks the environment. Text-only routes receive images as local paths. OCR uses macOS Vision; descriptions need Ollama and qwen3-vl.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:425-453","lib/index.js:458-507","lib/vision_analyze.swift:21-70"]}
